  "question": {
    "text": "If system of equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is inconsistent, then which of the following is correct?"
  },
